# Force LF line endings on checkout regardless of a contributor's local
# core.autocrlf setting -- prevents Windows checkouts from rewriting this
# repo's LF-committed text files to CRLF, which was tripping `prettier
# --check` (Prettier's default endOfLine is "lf") on every file, not just
# ones actually touched by a given change. Flagged (but never fixed) in
# Stories 1.4, 1.5, and 1.6's Dev Notes.
* text=auto eol=lf
